,"kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Suggestion chip is a UI element that allows to present recommended or predictive options based on user’s input or context,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and is commonly used to capture filtering decisions."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Suggestion chip is typically non-selected by default and can be tapped or clicked to apply the suggestion, streamlining input and enhancing usability."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Chips can show multiple interactive elements together in the same area, such as a list of selectable movie times, or a serie of email contacts."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Best suited for category-based filters that do not require additional visual elements."}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSSuggestionChip","url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudssuggestionchip"},"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents/OUDSImage":{"type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSImage","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"OUDSImage","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OUDSImage","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Use to provide an asset to ouds in order to be added in some components."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The icon can be flipped for RTL consideration and an associated "},{"code":"acessibilityLabel","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"must be provided"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"if the icon is not decorative."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSImage","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudsimage"}}}